OL,3,GNEWSALotus Cars celebrates 60 years of
OL,4,Atrade in Hethel
OL,5,
OL,6,FLotus Cars has opened the doors of its
OL,7,Fmanufacturing site to the public as it
OL,8,Fcelebrated 60 years of the brand being
OL,9,Fbased in a village.
OL,11,FThe company said about 1,600 people
OL,12,Fattended its event on Saturday at its
OL,13,Fsite at Hethel, Norfolk, with all
OL,14,Fticket proceeds going to the Priscilla
OL,15,FBacon Hospice Charity.
OL,17,FThe sports car firm, which was founded
OL,18,Fin the 1950s and moved to Norfolk in
OL,19,Fthe 1960s, provided James Bond's
OL,20,Funderwater car in The Spy Who Loved Me
OL,21,F1977 film.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
