OL,3,GNEWSALotus Cars celebrates 60 years of
OL,4,Atrade in Hethel
OL,5,
OL,6,FClive Chapman, whose father Colin
OL,7,FChapman founded Lotus, said: "To open
OL,8,Fup the factory site, which really is a
OL,9,Fcentre of modern engineering excellence
OL,10,Fto so many people today, is just
OL,11,Fterrific."
